msgid "Update BT Tracker"
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:316
msgid "Use a proxy server for all protocols."
msgstr "Úsáid seachfhreastalaí do gach prótacal."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:336
msgid ""
"Use the certificate authorities in FILE to verify the peers. The certificate "
"file must be in PEM format and can contain multiple CA certificates."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid na húdaráis deimhnithe i FILE chun na piaraí a fhíorú. Caithfidh an "
"comhad deimhnithe a bheith i bhformáid PEM agus is féidir teastais CA "
"iolracha a bheith ann."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:342
msgid ""
"Use the certificate for HTTP server. The certificate must be either in "
"PKCS12 (.p12, .pfx) or in PEM format."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:293
msgid ""
"Use the certificate for RPC server. The certificate must be either in PKCS12 "
"(.p12, .pfx) or in PEM format."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:346
msgid ""
"Use the private key for HTTP server. The private key must be decrypted and "
"in PEM format."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:300
msgid ""
"Use the private key for RPC server. The private key must be decrypted and in "
"PEM format."
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:412
msgid "User agent"
msgstr "gníomhaire úsáideora"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:268
msgid "Username & Password"
msgstr "Ainm Úsáideora & Pasfhocal"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:329
msgid ""
"Verify the peer using certificates specified in \"CA certificate\" option."
msgstr ""
"Fíoraigh an piaraí ag úsáid teastais a shonraítear i rogha “deimhniú CA”."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:242
